<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Kutanga kwa AkwaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 AkwaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu dyo Kutanga kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AkwaTesalonika</para>
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Yatwe twa Paulu, Silasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dithzina dyenthzi dimweya po Silivano.</char></note> na Timoti. Twaa ñorera amwe mwakwa kereke thzo mu Tesalonika, amwe mu di kwa Nyambi Tata noku kwa Fumu Yesu Krisitu. Thsihemo no thsiyaro thsa Nyambi ikare nenu.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsitawo thsakwakutawa o mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Twaa kandereranga kwa Nyambi thsikati thsothsihe mukaci kenu mwahe no ku mi vurukanga mwirombero yetu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />O ku tu rombera kwa Nyambi, aye Tata wetu twaa vurukanga etenda yenu yo thsitawo, ekwama yenu yo thsishimo, no kucithzua kwenu micima mukaci kokurupero wenu kwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Andengenu, tu na dimuka ci Nyambi aa mi shima, karo na a mi hangura ci mwikare anuenthzi. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Inene uya na tu mi tongwera Muthzimbu Ouwa, shime twaa u mi tongwera kadi ko maywi pohuma, unone kokoro no Mupepo Oukenu no ku rakwa shemwa kokukuru. Mu na dimuka edi na tu na yoyo mu kaci kenu no ku mi kwathsa. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Na mu tu temununa atwe na Fumu. Na mu tambura diywi ko thsinyanyu thso ku tunda ku Mupepo Oukenu shaanga ci nedi mu kaci ko makando oakuru. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Mukaci keyo, na mu nekara muro kwakwakutawa wahe o mu thsikiriti thsa Masedonia no mu Akaya.<verse eid="1TH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Mukaci keyi na mu tende, diywi dya Fumu ka di thzire ñua pohuma mu Masedonia no mu Akaya, unone thsitawo thsenu kwa Nyambi na thsi dimukiwa kokuhe, mweyo, kwithsa karo eyi nga tu amba keyi yenu. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Wahe a amba yodi mwa na tu tamburire nedi na mu thsiurukera kwa Nyambi ku thsia ku rombera ekupuro no ku kwamena Nyambi shemwa oyu yoya. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Karo aa tongaura edi mu na taterera kukeya kwa Mwane Yesu ku tunda ku wiru, oyu a pindurire kwafu, oyu na a tu amwena kuanthzi ou u keya.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ekwama ya Paulu mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="rem">MN, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Andengenu, mu na dimuka ci kuhungera kwetu ku kwenu nedi kadi kwa mbango. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Eci dyodi mu na dimuka, shime twaa nyandithsiwa no ku tukathzaniwa mu Filipi. Unone Nyambi na a tu pa ondume o ku mi tongwera Muthzimbu Ouwa keyi yenthzi, shaanga ci shime na tu rwithsiwa nene. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Mweyo, kuhonga kwetu ka na kwikara ko ku cireka, nji ku tunderera kwianekera yoimango nji ku ereka ku miangera.<verse eid="1TH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Shaanga apa i di kengeyo, twaa amba ko ku tu tawethza Nyambi, aye pa ku tu mona ci twaa roera ku tongora Muthzimbu Ouwa wenthzi. Ka tu tendire eyi ci tu nyanyukithse munu, unone ku nyanyukithsa Nyambi oyu na erekanga eanekera yo mu micima thzetu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Mu na dimuka namwe ci na dituci ku ereka ku mi kwatakwata pohuma pa meho. Nyambi aye shemwa na dimuka ci ka na tu miangera ku horeka rununa. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ka na tu foto ci nga mu tu shangare, nji munu yomuhe ku tu shangara.<verse eid="1TH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Ko kwikara tunganda twa Krisitu, shime twaa roera ku mi romba ci mu tu kwathse. Shaanga apa i di kengeyo, shime na tu cihenge eci mbuyama edi a na vavareranga anenthzi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Mweyo, pa ku mi shima nene, na tu foto nenenene kadi ku ciera nenu pohuma Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi, unone mofoci kengeyo no myoyo thzetu, inene mwaa shimiwa nene ku kwetu.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Andengenu, ene ka mu vurukire ekwama nekarupa yetu mu kaci kenu nji? Mwaa vuruka edi na tu na kwama othsiku no mutenya ku wana po ku yoyera, ci twekara mupango ouremu kwa munu yomuhe o ku tu honga Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Amwe po mwa mambangi weyo, no Nyambi naye na dimuka ci twa nekarire owakenu, owawawa no kupira kapongonyi ou twa nekarire mu kaci kenu amwe mwakwakutawa. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Namwe mu na dimuka ci shime twaa shimba munu no munu ku kwenu eci tata wa munu edi a kwama anenthzi. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Shime twaa mi tanarithsa, no ku mi hengawethza, no ku mi koñomeka ci mu yoye mwoyo ou u na roera kwa Nyambi, aye oyu mithsera mu Kutumina kwenthzi no mu kutethzima.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Karo twaa kanderera kwa Nyambi thsikati thsothsihe ci ou na mu tambura diywi dyenthzi edi mwa yuvire ku kwetu, ka na mu di tambura eci diywi dya munu. Uno honi na mu di tambura dyodi di di shemwa ci diywi dya Nyambi, pano honi dyodiyo edi di kwama ku kwenu amwe mwakwakutawa.<verse eid="1TH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Andengenu, amwe po na mu temununa makereke a Nyambi o mu Judea, aa a di kwa Krisitu Yesu. Shime na mu nyandithsiwa kwanuenu eci dyodi a nyandithsiwire kwaenthzo Majuda. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Awo Majuda epaire Fumu Yesu nakwakukethza, karo wodiyo awa na tu nyandithsa. Ka roerithsire Nyambi, karo akwethzimbo yanu wahe, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />pa ku tu kwangithsa kwo ku rongithsa diywi kwAnukenge ci nga a yoyithsiwe. Mweyo, aa ciungumekera evi yo ko kupiterera. Oanthzi wa Nyambi waa keya kukwo ku mamaneneno.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa fota ku hungerithsa kereke karo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Andengenu, ku tunda paya na tu tundithsiwera ku kwenu kamanana, ka na tu thsii ku mi anekera. Mu ku fota nene ci nga tu na mi hungerithsa, na tu ereka momuhe omu tu na twethsera ci tu mi hungerithse. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Shime twaa fota nene ci nga tu na keya ku kwenu, yoshemwa ame no Paulu na ni ereka rorungi, unone Satana na a tu kwangithsa. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Mweyo, okurupero wetu ne upi, no thsinyanyu thsetu, nji muyambo wetu ou twa ku cishangarera pa meho a Fumu wetu Yesu ou mba a ka huka? Ene kadi yamwe nji? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Yoshemwa yamwe awa tu cishangarera ko thsinyanyu!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Uno honi ou na tu kwanga ku i cithzua, ku hura na tu ciyuvu ci twikare twafoci mu mbongi thza Atene. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ngou honi na tu tumu muenthzetu Timoti oyu tu na kwama nenthzi ekwama ya Nyambi no ku rongithsa Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu, ci naa mi tanarithse micima no ku mi kwathsa mu thsitawo thsenu. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Inene ka tu fotire ci ku hukere munyima shaanga munu yofoci mukaci ko makando aa tu di nao. Unone namwe mu na dimuka ci Nyambi yodiyo naa i tawethza kengeyo ci tu nyandithsiwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Mane no uya na twikara nenu shime twaa i mi tongwera, ayo o ku i shime ku tendahara ci kenge twa ku nyandithsiwa. Karo dyo na i dikara kengeyo, namwe mu na i dimuka nawa. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Mweyo, ou na ni kwanga ku taterera thsikati thsothsire, o na ni mi tumithsera Timoti ku na mona thsitawo thsenu edi thsi di. Shime na ni yapa cingwa naa mi tumaura mukwakutumaura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Satana.</char></note> no kwipithsa ekwama yetu yoihe.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Pano honi Timoti naa na kumu ku tunda oko ku kwenu, karo naa na tu pa muthzimbu ouwa keyi yo thsitawo thsenu no thsishimo thsenu kengeyo. Shime naa na tu tongwera karo ci mwaa tu vurukanga ko thsinyanyu no ku tu rura nene, eci edi tu na mi ruranga natwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Mweyo, andengenu, mukaci ko thsitawo thsenu, tu na tanara micima mwikarupa no mu makando yoihe omu tu di. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Na i tu pa mwoyo ou na tu yuvu ci mu na tanara nene kwa Fumu.<verse eid="1TH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ngepi tu mi kanderera kwa Nyambi mukaci ko thsinyanyu thsothsikuru ethsi tu di nathso pa meho a Nyambi mukaci kenu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Twaa romberanga nene kwa Nyambi mutenya nothsiku ci tu wane thsikati thso ku na mi mona no ku na yarithserera eyi i na piri mu thsitawo thsenu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Nyambi Tata wetu mofoci kengeyo na Fumu wetu Yesu a tu wanene dikuñwa dyo ku keya ku na mi mona. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Fumu a kurithse thsishimo thsenu mane shime ku hupathzoka, no ku shima anu wahe eci edi tu na mi shimi natwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Ou mwa ku tenda kengeyo, naye kenge a ku tanarithsa micima thzenu, karo kenge mwa kwikara o kupira kapongonyi no kwikara owakenu pa meho a Nyambi Tata wetu, mu diyuwa dyo kukeya kwa Fumu wetu Yesu nanuenthzi owakenu wahe.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kuyoya ko ku roerithsa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ko kumanenena, andengenu, na mu cirongithsa kare ku kwetu edi mu na roera ku yoya ci mu twethse ku roerithsa Nyambi. Ii, kwaa yuvahara ci dyodiyo mu na yoyo. Uno honi twaa mi romba no ku mi adikanena mu dithzina dya Fumu Yesu ci mu tware ku rupara ku piterera apo. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Namwe mu na dimuka eraerera eyi na tu mi pa kokoro wa Fumu Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutunda ku thsivi thso ruthziho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Eshima ya Nyambi po ci nga mwikare anu owakenu, mu tunde ku thsivi thso ruthziho, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />ci nga munu yomuhe ku kwenu a dimuke ku endithsa erama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku cirongithsa dyo ku yoya na munuwoe, nji ku cirongithsa dyo ku wana mbuyama.</char></note> yenthzi no ku yoya ko kukena no ku ciremeka. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Ya mi endithsa ecikumbwethza yoimango eci mahedeni awa na kana ku dimuka Nyambi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Mweyi enu eyi, katere o wipithsere muenthzoe nji ku mu pupirika, inene awa tenda kengeyo Fumu Yesu kenge a ku wa pa humbithso, eci diya na tu mana ku mi koñomeka no ku mi nomenithsa. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nyambi shime naa twithsi ci tu yoye ko kukena kadi ku yoya mwoyo o dithziro. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Mweyo, o ku kana eyi erongithsa ka a kanine munu, unone aa kana Nyambi oyu naa mi pa Mupepo wenthzi Oukenu.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kucishima kwakwakutawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Uno honi keyi yo ku cishima naenthzenu po ka tu roerire ku i mi ñorera, inene Nyambi naa mi rongithsa kare edi mu na roera ku cishima. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Dyo mu na tendanga naenthzenu o mu Masedonia yomuhe. Unone, andengenu, twaa mi adikanena ci kucishima kwenu ku piterere apo.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Mu mone ci mwaa yoya ko thsiyaro, munu no munu a dimuke yenthzi pohuma. Karo mu kwame ko moko enu ku ciyoyithsa eci diya na tu mi tongwera, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />ci mu piwe direma kwanu awa a na kana ku tawa mukaci ko mikarero thzenu, ci katere mu kurupere enu yanu amweya.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya kwa Fumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Andengenu, twaa fota ci mu dimukere nawa eyi ya ku tendahara kwafu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Thsigerike thsaa amba ci awa a na rara. </char></note> ci mwekara mu mathsiwa eci edi a di amweya awa a na kana ku i kurupera. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Inene atwe twaa tawa ci Yesu wa fire no ku pinduka kwafu, mweyo, twaa tawa ci Yesu ou a ku ka huka, Nyambi kenge a ku ka huthsa nenthzi akwakutawa awa na fu.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Kokuthza ko maywi enthzi aye thsinda Fumu, twaa mi tongwera ci atwe twa ku yoya, atwe twa ku thsiarera shime ku ka kuma pa kukeya kwa Fumu, kadi cingwa yatwe twa ku tanga ku ka ciwana nenthzi ku thsia afu. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Inene Fumu aye thsinda kenge a ku keya ku tunderera ku wiru ko kakumbo ko ku raerera, ko diywi dyo mukuru o tungeru, no muvumo o torombita thza Nyambi. Awa fire o kwa na tawa kwa Krisitu wodiyo a kutanga ku pinduka kwafu. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Munyima thzeyo, atwe twa ku yoya mwethso thsikati, atwe twa ku thsiara pa kaye kenge twa ku humburiwa pofocino ku twariwa mu mavui ku ka ciwana na Fumu mu wiruwiru. Kenge twa ku kekara na Fumu diyere. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Mweyo, mu citanarithse micima kao maywi.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kuciroithsera kukeya kwa Fumu</para>
  <para style="rem">ML, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Uno honi, andengenu, ka tu roerire ci shime nga tu na mi ñorera keyi yekati no myaka edi ya ku tendahara. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Inene namwe mu na dimuka nawa ci diyuwa dya Fumu kenge dya ku keya eci mwithzi othsiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Popa a kuninga anu ci: “Pano honi ko thsi di thsiyaro, nenu i di nawa,” popo no dikarara podiyo dya ku wa wanena. Kenge ya kwikara eci kunyatithsa edi ku neyanga pa mbuyama oyu di poremu, kwithsa oyu wa ku para.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Andengenu, uno honi amwe ka mu di mu mirema ci edyo Diyuwa dya Fumu dya ku mi wane ko thsiundumukera eci mwithzi. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Inene mwaheno mwana mwethzi, karo mwana mutenya. Kadi twana othsiku nji ana mirema. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Mweyo, ka tu roerire ku cipitura eci amweya awa di pa turo, uno honi tu kothsoroke no ku cihenga. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Inene awa a rara aa raranga othsiku, nakwakupenda warwa aa pendanga othsiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Uno honi atwe po twakwa mutenya twaa roera ku cihenga. Karo twaa roera ku vata thsitawo no thsishimo eci thsicandekithso thso pa mbando thza dishwarare, nokurupero wetu o kuyoyithsiwa wikare eci thsikoko.<verse eid="1TH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nyambi ka a tu hangwerire humbithso thzoanthzi wenthzi, unone aa tu hangwera ci twa ku yoyithsiwe, ko ku cikwathsithsa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Aye shime a tu fererire ci twa ku twethse ku yoya nenthzi diyere, ikare o ku tu yoya nji o ku tu na fu. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Mweyo, mu citanarithse micima oandu no ku cikwatithsa oandu eci edi mu na kwamanga.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erongithsa yo mamaneneno no kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Andengenu, twaa mi romba ku remeka awa na kwama nene mu kaci kenu, awa a na mi endithsa mweyi ya Fumu no ku mi rongithsa dikuñwa dyodiwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Mwaa roera ku wa remeka nene no ku wa monithsa thsishimo mukaci kekwama eyi a kwama. Karo mu yoye ko thsiyaro mu kaci kenu.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Andengenu, twaa mi romba karo ci mu kuturure awa a na cikarera kwithsa ku kwama no ku tanarithsa awa a na faratera. Mu kwathse awa di no thsitawo thsothsipu, karo mu kwate mucima kwanu wahe. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Mu mone ci ku kwenu katere ku waniwe munu o ku huthsera omango komango, uno honi mu citanarithse thsikati thsothsihe ku citenda nawa mu kaci kenu, karo mu i tende kwanu wahe.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Mu roere thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Karo mu rombere thsikati thsothsihe. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Mu kanderere mwinu yoihe, inene eyi po yeshima ya Nyambi ku kwenu amwe mu di mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Mwa kwangithsa Mupepo Oukenu ku kwama. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Karo mwa shomorora okethzi, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />unone mu fotithsithse eyi a ambire. Mu hengeke yoiwa, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />mu tunde kwinu yoimango yoihe.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena kwa Paulu ko mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Nyambi oyu na tu panga thsiyaro a mi kenithse kwinu yoihe. Mupepo wenu ouhe no mwoyo nerama i hengekiwe nawa ko kupira kapongonyi, shime ku ka kuma pa kukeya kwa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Inene oyu naa mithsi wa ku rurama, kenge mba a i tenda.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Andengenu, mu tu romberere natwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Mu civumenenange nawa ko thsitawo naenthzenu wahe akwakutawa.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Naa mi adikanena mu dithzina dya Fumu ci mu varere edi diñoro pa meho akwakutawa wahe.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Thsihemo thsa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu thsikare nenu.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>